JigSeq PuzzleApp
================

Usage
-----
Run the app using a pre-generated RData file. Optionally specify the port:

	OUTDIR=<dir> ./run.R <RData> [port]

Connect using a browser at the printed local address.

Dependencies
------------
R (https://www.r-project.org/).

The following R dependencies are on the CRAN repository
(https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/).

Install these by running the following in R:

	install.packages("DT")
	install.packages("data.table")
	install.packages("dplyr")
	install.packages("ggplot2")
	install.packages("openxlsx")
	install.packages("plotly")
	install.packages("shiny")
	install.packages("shinyBS")
	install.packages("shinyWidgets")
	install.packages("shinyalert")
	install.packages("shinybusy")
	install.packages("shinyjs")
	install.packages("sortable")
	install.packages("stringr")
	install.packages("tidyr")

The following dependencies are available on Bioconductor
(https://www.bioconductor.org/install):

	install.packages("BiocManager")
	BiocManager::install("GenomicAlignments")
	BiocManager::install("VariantAnnotation")
	BiocManager::install("igvShiny")
	BiocManager::install("liftOver")

Session Info
------------
The app was developed using the following software versions:

R: 4.3.1 and 4.3.2
